@bank all
// W3, Lightdisc: anyone's fallback for section 23b's discTalk (lineFor(opp, 'disc.<kind>')), for opponents with no
// own lines: charged, curve, point, win (they win the game), lose (you win; proposed to 23b).
== disc.charged
- Charged one!
- Here it comes!
== disc.curve
- Curve!
- Watch it bend.
== disc.point
- Point!
- Ooh, close.
- That one's mine.
== disc.win
- Good game!
- That's the game. Again?
== disc.lose
- Well played!
- You got me. Rematch?
